  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Development Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the 2006/07 CAFOD worked with Mongu Diocese to develop a strategic plan for implementing a sustainable livelihoods programme in Mongu Diocese. After developing the strategic plan, CAFOD could not follow up with support to Mongu Diocese for implementing the livelihoods programme, as a result the Diocese could not implement some of the components of the strategic plan. Last year 2008, the Bishop of Mongu and management staff of Caritas Mongu requested for an urgent support from CAFOD to cover budget shortfalls for the livelihoods programme. CAFOD Harare proposes a programme development support to assist the Diocese of Mongu meet the budget shortfalls and fully implement the livelihoods programme. The project seeks to improve the development of the Mongu Livelihoods Programme. The project will achieve change through provision of support to the development of the livelihoods programme.</narrative>
  </description>
